  "meta": {
    "note": "Credentials: Header Auth «Authorization: token <api_key>:<api_secret>» of the connection user on the CRM calls; a Header Auth credential guards books-ask and books-decide, which act with the connection user's access to the books. Env: MUELLE_SITE_URL, MUELLE_BOOKS_WHSEC. See crm/docs/integrations/N8N.md. Callers of books-ask send {text, id}: the id makes their retry safe."
